{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If 60% of a number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is 40 then what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de1a36d69a7028480a87b712a7141c651398a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> of 60?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> എന്ന സംഖ്യയുടെ 60% 40 ആണെങ്കിൽ, 60-ന്റെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de1a36d69a7028480a87b712a7141c651398a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> എത്രയാണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>English:</b>\n</p><p>We have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57e00083382132bbc584d4a9a0e4093088d1bb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5} x = 40 \\implies \\frac{200}{3} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"183\" height=\"38\" /> hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/f/acfacfa73b81f3c5d3eda33e825acef3f6081af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 60 = \\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" /> is the answer.\n</p><p><b>Malayalam:</b>\n</p><p>നമുക്ക്  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/a/88a7e1d4ef953698efffa9a1085a1d383e9feeb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5}x = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" /> എന്ന് ലഭിക്കുന്നു <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e261cbf6b7a2b2b93a704d072ab8a733ecc41d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies x = \\frac{200}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/190782d546803d6f6eb493f2d4fa0eba11e19ad5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 60 = \\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" /> ആണ് ഉത്തരം.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1700/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37877:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070458 and revision id 292610. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}